title: The hidden messages come first in the subscribee, each with its chain of containers.
pid: 2406ff5f-63d0-4a9b-b572-9863917aab84
body: |2-
  In the view Jeff's server sent him, the three hidden messages stand
  before the first unread one, each with about eight lines of what
  contains it. It is folded, so it costs him little; it is still the
  first thing an unfold shows. Drew's.
